msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.8.3, our second (we skipped 3.8.0) maintenance release for the 3.8 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release contains bugfixes and documentation improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.8."
msgstr ""

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.8, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.8."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 3.x, please refer to the https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/[3.0 announcement] for all the details.\n"
"You can also refer to https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-upgrade/[this blog post] for additional details.\n"
"Once you upgraded to 3.0, also have a look at the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.1[3.1], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[3.2], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.3[3.3], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.4[3.4], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.5[3.5], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.6[3.6], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.7[3.7], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.8[3.8] migration guides."
msgstr ""

msgid "GraalVM SDK update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In Quarkus 3.8.3, we updated the GraalVM SDK artifacts version to 23.1.2.\n"
"It was an oversight and should have been done long ago."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are developing extensions containing GraalVM substitutions,\n"
"it is highly recommended to replace the `org.graalvm.sdk:graal-sdk` dependency with `org.graalvm.sdk:nativeimage`,\n"
"that only contains the classes required to develop substitutions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Also if you are using the Javascript polyglot features of GraalVM, `org.graalvm.js:js` should be replaced by:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.graalvm.polyglot:js-community` if you are using the community version of GraalVM"
msgstr ""

msgid "`org.graalvm.polyglot:js` if you are using the enterprise version of GraalVM"
msgstr ""

msgid "While the first change is handled by `quarkus update`, the second one has to be done manually depending on your GraalVM distribution of choice."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.8.3[the full changelog of 3.8.3 on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
